WEBVTT
Language: en

1
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:02.200
This extended description is intentionally much longer than the short pause in the picture, so the lesson pauses until the description finishes and then continues.

2
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.190
A phone is drawn on a paper-coloured screen, with a short caption under it.

3
00:00:05.190 --> 00:00:11.702
The caption bar grows taller. The letters are yellow on a black band.

4
00:00:11.702 --> 00:00:22.036
A second window lifts off the phone. It is labelled Ethiopian Sign Language.

5
00:00:22.036 --> 00:00:28.919
A round speaker icon appears beside the phone.

6
00:00:28.919 --> 00:00:36.761
The phone is replaced by a short stack of pages and a sound file.

7
00:00:36.761 --> 00:00:43.179
The stack of pages stays in the centre of the screen.
